  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "地理資訊系統概論",
    "sub_ename": "INTRODUCTION TO GEOGRAPHIC INFORMATION SYSTEMS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程目標在介紹地理資訊系統（GIS）與空間資訊之理論、應用層面與軟體操作，為GIS基礎課程。理論部分包含空間資訊基本概念、空間資料與屬性資料建立、遙測與GPS應用等。課程實作內容包括數位圖建立、主題地圖製作、空間分析等。本課程同時為院必修核心課程，可依各系之需求規劃與專業相關之主題地圖製作與空間分析內容。",
    "describe_eh": "The course objective is to introduce the theory, application level and software operation of Geographic Information System (GIS) and spatial information in this course, which is a basic course of GIS. The theoretical part includes basic concepts of spatial information, creation of spatial data and attribute data, remote sensing and GPS applications, etc. The experiments include digital map creation, thematic map making, spatial analysis, etc. This course is also a compulsory core course of the school, and the content of thematic map making and spatial analysis related to majors can be planned according to the needs of each department.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
